<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian weekly forex demand rises to $66.07 mln.</title>
<headline>Nigerian weekly forex demand rises to $66.07 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank on Thursday announced sales of forex at its latest weekly intervention on Wednesday, August 13:</p>
<p>			    13 August	     6 August</p>
<p>Amount sold	    $66.07		  $61.52 million</p>
<p>Dollar exchange rate  82.00		   83.00 naira</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
